WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.500
Hi there! Meet AgriTrace — we follow your produce from the farm all the way to the buyer.

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:09.000
Register your cooperative in minutes, then pick a plan that grows with your farmers.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:14.500
Keep track of farmers, plots and harvests — and give every batch its own QR code.

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:19.500
Scan a code and see the whole journey, step by step, from farm gate to export.

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:25.000
Watch your cold storage, and give buyers a friendly portal to check their orders.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
AgriTrace — made with care by Deeps Systems. Everything you see here is demo data.
